window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>This is the final book in the two-book duet. Book one must be heard first.</i></b> </p> <p>\"Deliciously dark, riveting, spell-binding. Ms. Jade had me frantically flipping pages until the perfect end. This series will be a favorite of mine and not just for 2019\" (<i>USA Today</i> best-selling author, Kate Stewart) </p> <p>\"I devoured this book and enjoyed every sizzling sexy detail. It's dark and gritty with a touch of suspense blended with erotic sex and delicious angst.\" (<i>New York Times </i>best-selling author, Tabatha Vargo)</p> <p>One man thinks I'm a saint. <br> The other thinks I'm a sinner. <br> One man lives in the public eye. <br> The other lurks in the shadows. <br> One man wants to use me for his own needs. <br> The other wants to use me for his revenge. </p> <p>One man will get what's coming to him. <br> The other will get what he deserves. </p> <p>They told me good girls get rewarded. <br> But I've been bad. Very bad. </p> <p><i>I made a deal with the Devil...and I liked it. </i></p> <p><b>Please note: This story contains content that may be offensive to some listeners.</b></p>"; 
